From 2c4dfef1bdee73f9994323c8139afd25768db150 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: CaptainCucumber <37813159+CaptainCucumber@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 14:48:14 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add retained capped native rail station and depot
 construction

Extend protocol v3 with typed infrastructure construction and status, capture created asset IDs, and persist schema-3 operation history with schema-1/2 migration.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
